<title>USA: Starlog completes acquisition of Goal Post.</title>
<headline>Starlog completes acquisition of Goal Post.</headline>
<dateline>UNION, N.J. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Starlog Franchise Corp said Friday that it completed the acquisition of Goal Post Distributing Inc on June 29.</p>
<p>Goal Post is a Florida-based trading card and collectibles company.  Starlog is an entertainment retailer specializing in science fiction, movie and television related products and collectibles.</p>
<p>Starlog said that the combined company's revenues over the last 12 months were about $7 million.  It added that it will seek other acquisitions.</p>
